[[1024,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on the ramp.</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237882\">1076A46</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237866\">1076B70</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237706\">1080B40</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237872\">1084C38</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Undo the nut securing the pipe bracket\nand separate the engine oil supply pipe to the cooling radiator\nfrom the return pipe.</p>"],[1024,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Assemble the engine oil pipe to the cooling\nradiator to the return pipe by means of the relevant bracket.</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237872\">1084C38</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237706\">1080B40</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237866\">1076B70</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237882\">1076A46</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Refill the engine oil lubrication system \n\n                                          <strong>- 0010T11 engine oil check level and top up</strong>\n                                           .</p><p>Remove the car from the ramps.</p>"]]